message: "If you refer to this design essay, please cite the article below."
title: "AI Roleplay With Long-Term Memory: Why Facts Aren't Enough"
abstract: >-
  A product design essay and proposed evaluation framework by the founder of
  ChatBrat AI. It discusses narrative consequences, callbacks, earned trust,
  character continuity, contextual memory use, and user agency. It separates
  illustrative design goals from verified product behavior and experimental
  results. No ChatBrat benchmark scores or comparative wins are reported.
